{"This removes the only right-alignment rule for the ERB header's `.panel`; `margin-left: auto` only works when `.panel` is a flex item, but `_header.html.erb` nests it inside `.row`.": 0.6571685671806335, "The `align-items` mixin emits `-ms-align-items`, which is not a valid vendor-prefixed CSS property. The correct IE prefix is `-ms-flex-align` (already present in the mixin). The invalid `-ms-align-items` line in the mixin should be removed to avoid confusion.": 0.5137277841567993, "Keep paragraph spacing inside `.custom-message`; zeroing `p` margins collapses multi-paragraph cooked messages into one block.": 0.6253818273544312}